### BUG-02 · Z-Index collision: Cart Drawer vs. Filter Drawer
| | |
|---|---|
| **Severity** | 🔴 Critical |
| **Type** | Overlap / Z-Index Conflict |
| **Files** | [`CartDrawer.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/agawa/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Fly%20Rc%20Project/torque-rc-store/src/components/cart/CartDrawer.tsx#L25-L34) · [`CollectionPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/agawa/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Fly%20Rc%20Project/torque-rc-store/src/pages/CollectionPage.tsx#L281-L288) |
| **Lines** | `CartDrawer.tsx:25` `z-[100]`, `:34` `z-[101]` · `CollectionPage.tsx:281` `z-[100]`, `:288` `z-[101]` |

**Root Cause:** Both drawers use the exact same z-index pair (`z-[100]` backdrop, `z-[101]` panel). If a user triggers one while the other is open, they share the same stacking plane and visually collide.

**Fix:** Establish a clear z-index hierarchy. The Cart Drawer should always sit **above** the Filter Drawer since it's globally accessible:
```diff
 // CartDrawer.tsx:25 — backdrop
-className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-[100]"
+className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-[110]"

 // CartDrawer.tsx:34 — panel
-className="fixed top-0 right-0 h-full w-full max-w-md bg-card border-l border-white/5 z-[101] flex flex-col"
+className="fixed top-0 right-0 h-full w-full max-w-md bg-card border-l border-white/5 z-[111] flex flex-col"
```
The Filter Drawer (`CollectionPage.tsx:281,288`) stays at `z-[100]`/`z-[101]` — no change needed there.

