### BUG-03 · Product Detail page content hidden under fixed header on mobile
| | |
|---|---|
| **Severity** | 🔴 Critical |
| **Type** | Spacing / Header Overlap |
| **Files** | [`ProductDetailPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/agawa/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Fly%20Rc%20Project/torque-rc-store/src/pages/ProductDetailPage.tsx#L49) |
| **Lines** | `ProductDetailPage.tsx:49` — `pt-24 md:pt-32` |

**Root Cause:** The header is `fixed top-0` and includes the `AnnouncementBar` (~28px) + the main nav bar (~52px on mobile). That's ~80px total. But the page uses `pt-24` (96px) on mobile which seems fine at first glance — except the breadcrumb is `hidden md:flex` (Line 52), so on mobile the **first visible content** is the product image at Line 63 which has no extra top spacing. When the header shrinks on scroll (`py-2`), it can overlap the top of the image container.

**Fix:**
```diff
 // ProductDetailPage.tsx:49
-<div className="pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-24">
+<div className="pt-28 md:pt-32 pb-24">
```

