### BUG-05 · Product Card: `truncate` on Terrain fails inside flex (no `min-w-0`)
| | |
|---|---|
| **Severity** | 🟠 High |
| **Type** | Flexbox / Overflow |
| **File** | [`ProductCard.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/agawa/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Fly%20Rc%20Project/torque-rc-store/src/components/product/ProductCard.tsx#L120) |
| **Lines** | `:120` |

**Root Cause:** The parent `<div>` is `flex` but has no `min-w-0` or `overflow-hidden`. Per CSS spec, flex children default to `min-width: auto`, preventing text truncation — the card stretches instead.

