### BUG-16 · Footer: Links use `<a href>` instead of `<Link to>` — causes full page reloads
| | |
|---|---|
| **Severity** | 🟡 Medium |
| **Type** | SPA Navigation |
| **File** | [`Footer.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/agawa/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Fly%20Rc%20Project/torque-rc-store/src/components/layout/Footer.tsx#L9-L54) |
| **Lines** | `:9`, `:37-41`, `:49-53` |

**Root Cause:** All internal links in the footer (`/collections/crawlers`, `/contact`, `/about`, etc.) use standard `<a href="...">` tags instead of React Router's `<Link to="...">`. This causes a full browser reload on every click, destroying SPA state (cart contents in memory, scroll position, etc.).

**Fix:** Replace all internal `<a href="...">` with `<Link to="...">`:
```diff
 // Footer.tsx — add import
+import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

 // Footer.tsx:9 (logo link)
-<a href="/" className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
+<Link to="/" className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
 ...
-</a>
+</Link>

 // Footer.tsx:37-41 (collection links) — repeat for each
-<a href="/collections/all-rc-models" ...>All RC Models</a>
+<Link to="/collections/all-rc-models" ...>All RC Models</Link>
```

